1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,080
Seen... and no reply.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,210
Mahadev, why do the people we trust most hurt us?

3
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,920
Someone else's behaviour doesn't decide your worth.

4
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:16,948
But how do I trust anyone again?

5
00:00:17,398 --> 00:00:20,753
Don't stop trusting... just recognise your boundaries.

6
00:00:21,203 --> 00:00:25,992
So I can forgive... but I don't have to give everyone their old place back?

7
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:29,780
Exactly. Compassion and protecting yourself can walk together.

8
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:34,487
I'll keep my heart clean... and open the door wisely.
